{"id":33695,"path":"/grammar-points/shorts/how-to-avoid-double-subjects-in-english-grammar-shorts/","parentId":30685,"order":120,"section":"grammar-points","level":null,"depth":3,"title":"How to avoid double subjects in English – Grammar Shorts","seo":{"title":"How to avoid double subjects in English – Grammar Shorts - Test-English","description":"Learn how to avoid double subjects in English. Grammar tips with examples, a clear chart, and an interactive exercise with instant feedback.","image":"/media/uploads/Avoiding-double-subjects-Grammar-shorts-1.webp"},"modified":"2025-06-04T16:08:56","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h2>How to Avoid Double Subjects in English</h2> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/How-to-avoid-double-subjects_Grammar-chart.webp\" alt=\"Infographic explaining how to avoid double subjects in English, with examples of incorrect and correct sentences using noun and -ing phrase subjects.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-34079\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <p>A <strong>double subject</strong> is a common grammar mistake that happens when the subject of a sentence is repeated unnecessarily — usually by using both a noun and a pronoun.<br> <br> Check these incorrect sentences:</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span>My brother and my cousin</span><strong><span> they </span></strong>never listen.</em> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"Incorrect sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em><span>The worst part of the exam</span><strong><span> it’s </span></strong>speaking.</em> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"Incorrect sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> </ul> <p>The problem with these sentences is that they repeat the subject. In the first sentence, <em>My brother and my cousin</em> is the subject of the verb <em>listen</em>, and <em>they</em> is another subject referring to the same people. In the second sentence, the same thing happens: <em>The worst part of the exam</em> is the subject, and <em>it</em> is also a subject. Each sentence should have only one subject.</p> <p>Here are the correct versions:</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>My brother and my cousin never listen.</em> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>They never listen.</em> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>The worst part of the exam is speaking.</em> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>It’s speaking.</em> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> </ul> <p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-33569\" src=\"/media/uploads/lightbulb-.png\" alt=\"Glowing yellow lightbulb icon, symbolizing an idea or inspiration.\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\"><strong>Tip:</strong> Only one subject is needed! If you start a sentence with a noun or an <strong>-ing</strong> verb, don’t add a pronoun after it. Here are more examples of double subject mistakes:</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Running every day <span><strong>it</strong></span> helps me relax.&nbsp;</em><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"Incorrect sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>Running every day helps me relax.</em>&nbsp;<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>It helps me relax.</em>&nbsp;<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>One of my best friends <span><strong>she</strong></span> lives in London.&nbsp;</em><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"Incorrect sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>One of my best friends lives in London.</em>&nbsp;<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>She lives in London.</em>&nbsp;<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>This new movie <span><strong>it’s</strong></span> very boring.&nbsp;</em><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"Incorrect sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>This new movie is very boring.</em>&nbsp;<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>It’s very boring.</em>&nbsp;<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>All the children at the party <span><strong>they</strong></span> were playing outside.&nbsp;</em><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"Incorrect sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>All the children at the party were playing outside.</em>&nbsp;<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>They were playing outside.</em>&nbsp;<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>My phone <span><strong>it</strong></span> doesn’t work.&nbsp;</em><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"Incorrect sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>My phone doesn’t work.</em>&nbsp;<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>It doesn’t work.</em>&nbsp;<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"Correct sentence\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> </ul> <div class=\"grammar-separator-dots\"><span>Take the Quiz!</span></div> <div data-quiz=\"1355\"></div>"],"explanation":null,"quizzes":[{"id":1355,"questions":[{"id":11578,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ ran across the street.</div>","choices":[{"id":21948,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> The dog it</span>"},{"id":21949,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> The dog</span>"}]},{"id":11579,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ speaks four languages.</div>","choices":[{"id":21950,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> My friend from Turkey</span>"},{"id":21951,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> My friend from Turkey she</span>"}]},{"id":11580,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ is the best medicine.</div>","choices":[{"id":21952,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> It</span>"},{"id":21953,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> Doing exercise it</span>"}]},{"id":11581,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ finished the test early.</div>","choices":[{"id":21954,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> Most students in my class they</span>"},{"id":21955,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> They</span>"}]},{"id":11582,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ really interesting.</div>","choices":[{"id":21956,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> This book it's</span>"},{"id":21957,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> This book is</span>"}]},{"id":11583,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ helps me relax.</div>","choices":[{"id":21958,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> It</span>"},{"id":21959,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> Walking in nature it</span>"}]},{"id":11584,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ are visiting next week.</div>","choices":[{"id":21960,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> My parents they</span>"},{"id":21961,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> My parents</span>"}]},{"id":11585,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ takes time.</div>","choices":[{"id":21962,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> Learning English it</span>"},{"id":21963,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> Learning English</span>"}]},{"id":11586,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ getting colder.</div>","choices":[{"id":21964,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> It's</span>"},{"id":21965,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> The weather it's</span>"}]},{"id":11587,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ was wearing a red hat.</div>","choices":[{"id":21966,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> The man he</span>"},{"id":21967,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> He</span>"}]}]}]}